ical from both teams but good attitude and communication from you guys throughout the game"},{"game_id":39,"givento":"Korea Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":"Thanks for a really enjoyable fair minded game of ultimate"},{"game_id":138,"givento":"Japan Open","cat1":2,"cat2":3,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":12,"comments":"Fantastic well spirited game, thank you team Japan"},{"game_id":137,"givento":"Philippines Open","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":1,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":8,"comments":"We felt a bit like the discussions were a bit negative and weren’t talked about with an open mind to both peoples perspectives. There was a lot of body hits on deep shots (I know this is hard to control in a competitive game). Hope to see you guys in the finals."},{"game_id":143,"givento":"Japan Open","cat1":2,"cat2":3,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":12,"comments":"A very close, intense and high spirit game. It was a pleasure to play 3 great games against you all."},{"game_id":145,"givento":"Singapore Open","cat1":1,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":3,"total":11,"comments":"Thanks for a very close hard game to finish. We were very happy with your communication and your positive attitude throughout the game. It was a pleasure to play. There were a couple of instances where the rules were applied incorrectly including an offside call. However the game was very good and very enjoyable and was well spirited. Thank you!"}],"spiritreceived":[{"game_id":32,"givenby":"Philippines Open","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":9,"comments":null},{"game_id":38,"givenby":"SGP Club Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":37,"givenby":"Japan Open","cat1":2,"cat2":3,"cat3":3,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":12,"comments":null},{"game_id":40,"givenby":"Singapore Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":"Great sidelines and cheering. Comms was great too! "},{"game_id":39,"gi